        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 11.4. Vacations shall be taken at such time as the Company shall determine, subject as far as is practicable, to the personal preference of the employee. A master vacation schedule with available weeks shall be distributed to each reporting center/work group, whichever is applicable, where the employee(s) selection(s) will be made in accordance with their seniority. At the time the selection is made the employee will submit a written verification of their choice. The Company shall maintain a current status of the selection process,",
